  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProjectRidge.Items.Clue
  focus: {fileID: 0}
  displayName: the small shoe
  title: A SMALL RED SNEAKER
  body: 'Leo''s. The laces are still double-knotted, the way you taught him.

    The
    mud around it is churned. Long, narrow prints, too far apart to be a man''s.


    They
    came this way. They were running.'
  objectiveAfter: Find where they went.
